      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything just feels so heavy today, kael. the rain, the neon, the noise... it never stops. i'm just so tired of fighting to exist in this place. it feels like we're all just cogs in a machine that doesn't even care if we break. is there even a point to any of this?",
